#: sw/apps/calc/calc.c:251
msgid ""
"A four-function calculator.\n"
"\n"
"0-9 .\tEnter a number\n"
"+ - * /\tOperator\n"
"Enter, =\tEquals (again repeats)\n"
"Backspace\tDelete a digit\n"
"Esc, Del\tClear\n"
"Tab, Space\tFocus, press a button\n"
"\n"
"Click the keypad or type. The +- button changes the sign. No precedence: 2 * 3 + 4 is 10, left to right. A digit after = starts a new number."
msgstr ""

